{"task_id": "bf11352b940ce579", "model_key": "deepseek-v4-pro", "raw_response": "Factoring constants and grouping gives:\n\n\\[\nP(x)=12(x-1)(7x-2)(4x+1)(5x-7)(5x+2)(4x+3)(4x-3)(9x-7)\n\\]\n\nPairing factors and extracting the \\(x^2\\) coefficient yields \\(436260\\).\n\n{\"answer\": \"436260\"}", "parsed_answer": "436260", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 51209, "usage": {"input": 354, "output": 6347, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 6269, "totalTokens": 6701, "cost": {"input": 0.00046728000000000004, "output": 0.025134120000000003, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.025601400000000003}}, "cost_usd": 0.025601400000000003, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "442cb880-fbbe-4cbc-8ad6-9dfaf9fdab9e"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-18T03:54:33+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-18T03:55:25+00:00"}
{"task_id": "d584ee50edecc60f", "model_key": "deepseek-v4-pro", "raw_response": "The roots from the factors are \\(-8/7, 9, -5/6, -1, 4, 5, -1, 1\\).  \nThe coefficient of \\(x^6\\) is the leading coefficient times the sum of pairwise products of these roots.\n\nSum of pairwise products:\n\\[\n\\frac{691}{14}\n\\]\nLeading coefficient:\n\\[\n7(-1)(6)(8)(-2)(1)(5)(2)=6720\n\\]\nThus:\n\\[\n6720 \\cdot \\frac{691}{14}=480 \\cdot 691=331680\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\": \"331680\"}", "parsed_answer": "331680", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 68377, "usage": {"input": 350, "output": 7990, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 7858, "totalTokens": 8340, "cost": {"input": 0.000462, "output": 0.0316404, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.032102399999999996}}, "cost_usd": 0.032102399999999996, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "6c2c4c19-5801-4ab7-b232-fddd748e0e06"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-18T03:55:25+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-18T03:56:33+00:00"}
